Aus #98. --attach wird an _spawn_raider durchgereicht, aber nie benutzt. Die attach-Hilfe verspricht einen Event-Stream, der Befehl gibt nur Slot, PID und Log-Pfad aus. Entweder implementieren oder Hilfe/Option ehrlich machen.

2026-09-29 17:53 Decision: implement. Existing machinery fits: every hall run writes its --stream-json events to .raider-hall/logs/ID.events.jsonl, hall attach already returns events_path, and logs --follow has the poll-until-reaped loop. attach ID follows the events file (JSONL on stdout) until the raider is reaped; spawn --attach spawns, then follows (spawn reply gains events_path so a run that ends before the first poll is still printed). The hall-side attach arg is dead (attach is client-side) and is removed from spawn/_spawn/_spawn_raider/queue entries/Protocol.

